{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"She sighs. \"I find it also wears them down.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T13:54:16.187000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869216052574322738","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Well... My kind tend to live no more than say 100 years..... I have spent hundreds of years in the big war.... so lifetimes.\" he relies to Roy, then addresses Irynx \"You have to step up.... or fall forever.... I wasn't about to give up..... \" he shrugs \"You never know what you are capable of until you are put into a situation\" he says with a hint weariness","created_at":"2021-07-26T13:56:37.886000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869216646902996992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I suppose it's a little bit of both. You learn the protect the pieces that survive. Strengthen those parts of you that are left.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T13:57:23.911000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-26T14:00:41.636000Z","id":"869216839945814106","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he nods \"My first life was only about 20 years..... so in a way even a hundred years would be like 5 lifetimes....\" he says looking at his hands \"but yes... you are flayed by war.... the weakest parts of you removed.... all that is left is your core ideology.... and I can tell you... its not easy being a man of peace and bound to war..... Every day is a test...\" he trails off lost in thought","created_at":"2021-07-26T13:59:42.325000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869217420496207923","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...I'm sorry. That sounds...'","created_at":"2021-07-26T14:00:03.845000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869217510757642241","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Its life.... a crucible.... Why do you think I say enjoy every day as best you can\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T14:00:40.834000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869217665900757022","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
